<title>AUSTRIA: Radex says Warburg holds 5.45 pct of stock.</title>
<headline>Radex says Warburg holds 5.45 pct of stock.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. investment house Warburg, Pincus Counsellors, Inc. holds 5.45 percent of shares in fireproof material maker Radex Heraklith in client accounts and funds, Radex said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Radex said a strong drive to build up its client base in the United States in the first half of 1997 had led to a significant rise in the number of U.S. institutional investors. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12257</p>
</text>
